	quest.3D1B18B5AA8AE800.title: "&d正在捕获中"
	quest.3D1C0F80B74B27D5.quest_subtitle: "抵达一座灯塔"
	quest.3D8504FE7ABEF341.title: "黄金工具"
	quest.3D9A982B63582765.quest_subtitle: "终极奇点 (The Ultimate Singularity)"
	quest.3D9A982B63582765.title: "&5&l&o统御万物的唯一者"
	quest.3DB4947E245FFFEF.quest_desc: [
		"此增强模块可添加至任何具有范围的模块（Sender Mk1/Mk2、Puller Mk1/Mk2、Extruder Mk1/Mk2、Vacuum）。"
		""
		"可堆叠；每个增强模块都会将模块的扫描范围减少一个方块。这可能仅在配合真空模块使用时才有用，以控制其扫描物品的范围。"
	]
	quest.3DDCCD4A784C8E5D.quest_subtitle: "&b等级：&r &94"
	quest.3E0314F44C51E728.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Keycard Reader&r emits a &o&b15&r-block &o&bredstone signal&r if you insert a &dKeycard&r that matches with the reader's settings. You can configure the &6Keycard Reader&r by &eRight+clicking&r it with anything other than a &o&blinked keycard&r. The signature is a number that &nlinks&r the &o&breader&r and &o&bkeycards&r together. Only keycards that have &o&bthe same signature&r as the reader they were &nlinked to&r will open said reader. Keycards linked to readers of &o&bother players&r will not work for your &6Keycard Readers&r. You can have multiple &6Keycard Readers&r with &o&bthe same signature&r, and all your keycards &o&bwith that signature&r will work on them as well. The keycard &o&blevel buttons&r on the right side of the &o&bGUI&r are individual to each &6Keycard Reader&r and define which &o&bkeycard levels&r can be used to activate this &6Keycard Reader&r."
		""
		"&n&b已接受的模组：&r"
		""
		"• 在钥匙卡读取器中添加&6白名单模块&r将&n允许&r列出的玩家&o&b将其自己的钥匙卡&r与读取器关联，并查看其设置。"
		"• 在钥匙卡读取器中添加&6黑名单模块&r，将禁止&n列出的玩家&r与该读取器互动。"
		"• Adding a &6Disguise Module&r to a keycard reader will &ncause&r the texture \\& model of it &o&bto change&r to the     texture \\& model of the block that is added to the &6Disguise Module&r."
		"• 将&6智能模块&r添加到钥匙卡读取器上，将&n允许&r钥匙卡读取器接受&o&b不受限制的钥匙卡级别&r。"
		""
		"此方块&o&b可抵抗爆炸&r，且只能由放置它的玩家使用&c通用方块移除器&r&n&r破坏。此方块可用&2声波安全系统&r锁定。"
	]
	quest.3E20B41FC6348BEB.quest_desc: [
		"&n&l&e奇异之眼&r"
		""
		""
		"&o&b\"带领追随者前往亚特兰蒂斯……或是送他们走向毁灭。\"&r"
		""
		"&n&9原始来源&r:"
